{
  "mn96:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 96 ",
  "mn96:0.2": "Esukārīsutta ",
  "mn96:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn96:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn96:2.1": "Atha kho esukārī brāhmaṇo yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodi. ",
  "mn96:2.2": "Sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā ekamantaṁ nisīdi. Ekamantaṁ nisinno kho esukārī brāhmaṇo bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn96:3.1": "“brāhmaṇā, bho gotama, catasso pāricariyā paññapenti—",
  "mn96:3.2": "brāhmaṇassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti, khattiyassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti, vessassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti, suddassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti. ",
  "mn96:3.3": "Tatridaṁ, bho gotama, brāhmaṇā brāhmaṇassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti: ",
  "mn96:3.4": "‘brāhmaṇo vā brāhmaṇaṁ paricareyya, khattiyo vā brāhmaṇaṁ paricareyya, vesso vā brāhmaṇaṁ paricareyya, suddo vā brāhmaṇaṁ paricareyyā’ti. ",
  "mn96:3.5": "Idaṁ kho, bho gotama, brāhmaṇā brāhmaṇassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti. ",
  "mn96:3.6": "Tatridaṁ, bho gotama, brāhmaṇā khattiyassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti: ",
  "mn96:3.7": "‘khattiyo vā khattiyaṁ paricareyya, vesso vā khattiyaṁ paricareyya, suddo vā khattiyaṁ paricareyyā’ti. ",
  "mn96:3.8": "Idaṁ kho, bho gotama, brāhmaṇā khattiyassa pāricariyaṁ paññapenti. ",
  "mn96:3.9": "Tatridaṁ, bho gotama, brāhmaṇ